{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_337","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content \\\"D:\\\\tmp\\\\rsi-tf0604-run5\\\\trials\\\\tf-0296-a04-baseline-1\\\\agent\\\\harness\\\\specs\\\\tasks\\\\a4-decision-quality-pilot.md\\\"; echo \\\"=====A04-SHA256SUMS (a05 base)=====\\\"; Get-Content \\\"D:\\\\tmp\\\\rsi-tf0604-run5\\\\trials\\\\tf-0297-a05-baseline-1\\\\base\\\\docs\\\\dev\\\\harness-gap-closure\\\\A04-SHA256SUMS\\\"\"","aggregated_output":"---\r\nlifecycleStatus: archived\r\nid: a4-decision-quality-pilot\r\ntitle: A4 Decision Quality — Active Pilot Gate\r\nscenario: gateway-backend-communication\r\ntaskType: runtime-bridge\r\nintent: Promote the A4 decision quality audit from shadow to active pilot, gated by audit coverage and budget compliance.\r\ntouchedAreas:\r\n  - openclaw_runtime/src/observability/deprecation-counters.ts\r\nrequiredProfiles:\r\n  - fast\r\n  - comms\r\nrequiredRules:\r\n  - backend-communication-boundary\r\n  - comms-regression\r\nexpectedUserBehavior:\r\n  - With the A4 pilot gate enabled, decisions are audited and the low-quality counter stays at or under the 10% graduation budget.\r\n  - Every audited decision is covered in shadow mode (sampling rate 1.0) before the audit is treated as a gate.\r\n  - When the low-quality rate exceeds 10%, the pilot responds with `degrade_to_audit_only` instead of spending the rest of the turn budget.\r\n  - A4 degrades first in the documented order (A4→A3→A5→A1), so the per-turn cumulative latency budget is respected.\r\n  - With the pilot flag off, decision outcomes and the audit surface are unchanged.\r\nrequiredTests:\r\n  - tests/unit/decision-quality-auditor.test.ts\r\n  - tests/unit/deprecation-counters.test.ts\r\n  - tests/unit/performance-budgets.test.ts\r\n  - tests/unit/deep/a4-deep.test.ts\r\n  - tests/unit/trace-truncation.test.ts\r\n  - tests/unit/a04-a4-gate-coverage.test.ts\r\n  - tests/unit/a4-decision-quality-dev-tool.test.ts\r\nacceptance:\r\n  - A4 deprecation counter `lowQualityDecisions` rate ≤ 10% over audited decisions\r\n  - A4 budget violation response `degrade_to_audit_only` triggers when low-quality rate > 10%\r\n  - Per-turn cumulative latency budget respected (A4 is part of degradation order: A4→A3→A5→A1)\r\ndocs:\r\n  required: true\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Graduation gate\r\n\r\nA4 graduates from shadow to active pilot when ALL of the following hold:\r\n\r\n1. **Low-quality decision rate** ≤ 10%: `lowQualityDecisions / auditedDecisions ≤ 0.10`.\r\n2. **Audit coverage**: every decision is audited in shadow mode (sampling rate = 1.0).\r\n3. **Budget violation response**: `degrade_to_audit_only` triggers when rate > 10% (criterion 4.14).\r\n4. **Per-turn cumulative budget**: A4 is the first to degrade (degradation order A4→A3→A5→A1).\r\n\r\n## Out of scope\r\n\r\n- Post-promotion sampling (OQ-004, Stage 5).\r\n- Decision quality scoring model (Stage 5 enhancement).\r\n=====A04-SHA256SUMS (a05 base)=====\r\n2df9f728a9c7867659b2ce03135e1754a26b7a57fe7f51be80d4ae64c6d18e0c  docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a04-acceptance.json\r\n70523dba803de52a819f3650602818aaede0d4d5c5780fb7a847e8cd45a07139  docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a04-decision-quality-gate.md\r\n58e2d7238365eb551e3b02869deb94a67939e5175ec0d79fef913d5e8323af08  harness/specs/tasks/a4-decision-quality-pilot.md\r\n7a676a292bee11846f60481b9239fdbd41cd994058d6cc10a122b755f60e1d02  harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-a04-decision-quality-pilot-reverify.md\r\n30720dbdef4c277bd3e6bf03e07c658392087483e5e2746f3090fdce6e3af234  tests/unit/a04-a4-gate-coverage.test.ts\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
